#
# One anchor per line the rules compute or deliberately leave out. Lines 17,
# 27, 31 and 32 to 36 are on the form but always nothing here: nonresident
# withholding, estimated tax penalties (REV-1630), credit forward to 2026 and
# refund donations are not modelled.

